        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "29271435F9FB34A4",
      "text": "Lors du dernier cours, nous avons tenté\\nde définir l’art. Un sujet qui n’a peut-être pas\\r\\nsemblé passionnant pour tout le monde...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "29271535F9FB3657",
      "text": "Pour ce cours, j’ai donc essayé de trouver un\\nmoyen d’éveiller votre intérêt pour ma matière.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "29271235F9FB313E",
      "text": "J’ai ainsi décidé de faire intervenir un invité\\nde marque ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_02_poke_01",
      "hash64": "877FFE16215C5A3F",
      "text": "Grik grik !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "29271335F9FB32F1",
      "text": "Je vous présente monsieur Griknot ! Il sera\\nmon assistant pendant ce cours.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "29271035F9FB2DD8",
      "text": "Cher monsieur Griknot, procédez à votre\\nTéracristallisation, je vous prie ![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_02_poke_02",
      "hash64": "877FFF16215C5BF2",
      "text": "Griiik !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "29271135F9FB2F8B",
      "text": "Voyez-vous... Les Pokémon peuvent exécuter\\nce que l’on nomme une Téracristallisation\\r\\nà condition d’utiliser un Orbe Téracristal.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
